          "**Read through try_beta** (Get-FmwBetaCollection): a refused call, or a 400, 404 or 501, returns available: false; the task reports \"evaluated\": false, stage beta",
          "A 403, or throttling that outlasts the retries, still raises: those aren't beta problems",
